    "chunk_text": "in \u00f0am tune \u00fee hatte Spaniaca. NO01C4 \u00d0a het Aurelianus se casere hyne mid witum \u00fereatian from Cristes geleafan. NO01C5 \u00d0a he \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafode, \u00fea het he hyne belucan in carcerne VI dagas ond VI niht ond XII NO01C9 \u00d0a w\u00e6ron him \u00f0a hundas milde for godes egesan ond his na ne onhrinon. NO01C10 \u00d0a \u00f0y VIan d\u00e6ge het se casere him forslean \u00feone sweoran. NO01C12 \u00d0a sona com fleogan of \u00f0am carcerne snawhwit culfre, ond seo fleah to heofenum. NO01C13 Ond \u00f0\u00e6r com to \u00f0am lichoman swy\u00f0e wynsum stenc ond eac fyrhto mid. NO01C15 Ond sum Cristen wif on niht genam \u00f0one lichoman ond hyne arwy\u00f0lice bebyrgde, ond \u00e6t NO06A1 On \u00f0one VI d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s abbodes geleornes sancti Wunnoci. NO06A2 He w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6s mynstres hlaford \u00f0e be su\u00f0e s\u00e6 is nemned Wurmhol, ond he w\u00e6s hw\u00e6\u00f0ere NO06A6 Ond \u00e6t nehstan \u00fea he ealdode ond he ne myhte ute wyrcan, \u00fea wolde he grindan mid his NO06A9 \u00d0a sona \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6re cweorna neal\u00e6hte ond \u00fe\u00e6t corn \u00fe\u00e6r onl\u00e6gde \u00fea orn seo cweorn \u00f0urh NO06A13 \u00d0a \u00e6t nehstan w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r swylc genihtsumnes meluwes \u00f0\u00e6t hy \u00f0\u00e6t ealle wundredon NO06A15 \u00d0a sume d\u00e6ge an \u00f0ara bro\u00f0ra locode in \u00f0\u00e6t hus \u00fe",
